    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπι-κλύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>listen to, hear</i>, c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ πάντ᾽ αἶνον ἐπέκλυε Νηλεΐδαο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.652
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.598
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοῦ φωνήμαθ᾽ ὡς ἐπέκλυον βοῶντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			: c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ δὴ Ζηνὸς ἐπέκλυεν ἀγγελιάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.150
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.1240
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eratosth.
				19
			</span></i>.</div>
